        <activityName xml:lang="en">Dismantling, laptop, manually, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Dismantling, laptop, manually, at plant
manual dismantling in various fractions based on common transfer coefficients for this type of treatment. Data from own experiences in Switzerland. No updates were made in 2023, as the transportation system is already recent. The pedigree matrix for uncertainties are nevertheless adapted for the year 2023; UUID: 52e93c90-c9e4-48ba-8152-4d8e2ddda97c
This dataset represents the manual dismantling of a WEEE devices in Switzerland.
Location: data of situation in Switzerland
Technology: current manual dismantling activities in Switzerland.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: own experiences
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_52e93c90-c9e4-48ba-8152-4d8e2ddda97c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
